      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1e — Scanner (hh.ru RSS)\n\n**Works on n8n Cloud** (no sidecar). Public RSS only — no HeadHunter API auth.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Read Profile + enabled Search Queries (`Source Type = HH RSS`)\n2. Build feed URLs (`text=` + `area=` with encodeURIComponent)\n3. Loop feeds (batch 1) → RSS Read → parse/filter → Wait 1s\n4. Aggregate → dedupe vs Pipeline → create net-new rows\n\n**Schedule:** Daily **8:20 AM** (after 1d JobSpy at 8:15)\n\n**Profile auto-feeds:** Up to 8 Target Roles when RU geography set; skipped when no RU-relevant geo (manual HH RSS queries still run).\n\n**Safety brake:** Max 100 net-new Pipeline records per run.\n\n**Job IDs:** FNV-1a hash + `-hhr` suffix. Source: `hh.ru`.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 400
